{"id":"649777","name":"生菜牛肉拌饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/649777/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"4片"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜瓣","amount":"2个"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1~2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所有食材：牛肉、生菜、鸡蛋、小米椒、蒜。","img":"images/649777/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉切片，放入酱油、蚝油、胡椒粉、淀粉、油，搅拌入味。","img":"images/649777/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生菜切碎。","img":"images/649777/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜切粒，小米椒切圈。","img":"images/649777/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小碗中放入拌饭酱、蚝油、酱油，加入适量的水拌匀。","img":"images/649777/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅热油，鸡蛋入锅煎。","img":"images/649777/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煎至定型，铲出备用。","img":"images/649777/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"剩下的油用来炒牛肉。","img":"images/649777/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒至变色。","img":"images/649777/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入生菜。","img":"images/649777/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"生菜翻炒片刻，出锅。","img":"images/649777/step_11.jpeg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅中放少量油，把蒜末、辣椒炒出香气。","img":"images/649777/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入拌饭汁，煮至浓稠。","img":"images/649777/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"盛出白米饭。","img":"images/649777/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"把炒好的菜和拌饭汁盖入米饭，拌匀即可。","img":"images/649777/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。营养均衡，超有满足感。","img":"images/649777/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}